nt last thing any  update on ryan and tank uh negotiations  zero whatsoever but there are talks  hey we're trying to get a hold of  tanks we don't know who to talk to  nobody picks up their phone  nobody calls back  i feel they're playing games so i'm  moving on  and i'm going to teal females fight next  week there you have ashley  de la hoya will be at tiofimo lopez's  next fight and it seems like a fight  between lopez and garcia could  materialize when asked by max kellerman  on a recent episode of max unboxing if a  fight with ryan garcia interested him  lopez didn't hold back  honestly to be real i'm willing to take  on anyone i've always been that way it's  the takeover nothing really changes from  this point forward former ufc light  heavyweight champion yan wakovic made  his case to dana white on twitter that  he deserves to challenge yurya prohaska  for the light heavyweight title wakovic  opened up with a list of facts about  himself in the tweet facts as a first  male fighter in poland i became the ufc  champion because of my work my name  garners respect never shied away from  any challenge i went to the ufc to  create great moments for the fans i'm  not done yet he followed that tweet with  another directly asking dana for the  title shot at dana white no [ __ ] no  politics no nonsense give me prohaska  and i'll give you the biggest mma fight  in europe's history unlike him i always  keep my word tony ferguson has a new  fight team according to a post on social  media ferguson will now be fighting  under the jackson wink mma name out of  new mexico ferguson has lost his last  four fights and is looking for change to  get him back on track jackson wink mma  has an impressive list of alumni  including holly holm and jon jones will  ferguson's first opponent fighting out  of his new gym be dan hooker hooker has  called out ferguson multiple times over  the past couple of weeks and did so  again days ago in a tweet madison square  garden ufc 281 let's get 